_build/
# ...except the built prod release, which the README's fast incremental
# Complement rebuild copies straight into an existing image. Without this
# exception that recipe fails with "/_build/prod/rel/axon: not found",
# since the path is excluded from the build context before COPY sees it.
!_build/prod/rel/axon/
deps/
.git/
.github/
.elixir_ls/
*.log
erl_crash.dump
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
e2e-client/node_modules/
e2e-client/test-results/
e2e-client/playwright-report/
